{
  "title": "Synthesis, Structure, and Magnetism of a Family of Heterometallic {Cu2Ln7} and {Cu4Ln12} (Ln = Gd, Tb, and Dy) Complexes: The Gd Analogues Exhibiting a Large Magnetocaloric Effect",
